OL,3,ALegendary Star Trek actor Sir Patrick
OL,4,AStewart dies aged 86
OL,5,
OL,6,FStewart died at his home in Los Angeles
OL,7,Fon Wednesday, according to a statement
OL,8,Fshared on his social media
OL,10,FThe award-winning star had a career
OL,11,Facross decades - from the Shakespearean
OL,12,Fstage, to the X-Men franchise
OL,14,FHis appeal crossed generations, and
OL,15,Fyounger fans will have discovered his
OL,16,Fwork on streaming platforms, writes our
OL,17,Fculture correspondent Noor Nanji
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
