OL,3,A'Painful' years ahead, think tanks
OL,4,Awarn, as living standards set to fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey said his Budget
OL,7,Foffered "breathing space", but said the
OL,8,Fgovernment could "never remove
OL,9,Fcompletely" cost of living pressures.
OL,11,FThe UK's official forecaster said its
OL,12,Flatest economic forecast painted a
OL,13,F"pretty grim picture".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
