OL,3,AAudio reveals exchanges between Spain
OL,4,Atrain operators and drivers moments
OL,5,Abefore deadly crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree audio recordings between Madrid's
OL,8,Fcontrol centre and two train drivers
OL,9,Fappear to show that one high-speed
OL,10,Ftrain was given clearance to move even
OL,11,Fthough another train had stalled on the
OL,12,Ftrack, about 25km (15 miles) ahead.
OL,14,FPrime Minister Pedro Sanchez has said
OL,15,Fthat authorities will "get to the
OL,16,Fbottom of every last detail of this
OL,17,Ftragedy".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
