OL,3,ARussian drone attack on Ukrainian train
OL,4,Astation kills at least 14, officials
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 14 people have been killed
OL,8,Fafter a Russian jet-powered drone hit a
OL,9,Fcrowded platform at the main railway
OL,10,Fstation in the central Ukrainian city
OL,11,Fof Dnipro, local officials have said.
OL,13,FDnipropetrovsk regional head Oleksandr
OL,14,FHanzha said at least 14 others were
OL,15,Fwounded in the attack, including an
OL,16,F11-year-old boy.
OL,18,FUkraine's state railway operator,
OL,19,FUkrzaliznytsia, said a passenger train
OL,20,Fheaded for the southern city of
OL,21,FZaporizhzhia was at one of the
OL,22,Fplatforms in Dnipro when the drone hit.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
